<title>BRAZIL: Caspian hires Brazil capital goods sector analyst.</title>
<headline>Caspian hires Brazil capital goods sector analyst.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said it has hired Paul Camargo as equity analyst to cover Brazil's building materials and capital goods sectors.</p>
<p>Before joining Caspian, Camargo had been covering Latin America for Value Vest, a buy side investment company based in Sao Francisco.</p>
<p>Camargo will be based in Caspian's Sao Paulo office.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
